    <string name="tutorial_welcome_title">Welcome to BasicPlanner!</string>
    <string name="tutorial_welcome_body">Hi! Welcome to BasicPlanner — your personal training planner. We will start the tutorial. First of all, right now you are on the Agenda screen, but we will come back here in a few minutes. Press Next to continue.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_create_title">Create your first program</string>
    <string name="tutorial_create_body">So now we are on the Agenda screen. But first of all, let\'s create our first program: click on the + button (see the arrow).</string>
    <string name="tutorial_creation_title">The Creation screen</string>
    <string name="tutorial_creation_body">You are now on the Creation screen. To create your first exercise, click on the + button (see the arrow).</string>
    <string name="tutorial_type_title">1. Choose the type</string>
    <string name="tutorial_type_body">In the dialog, choose \'Exercise\' as the type of entity you want to create.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_movement_title">2. Name &amp; movement</string>
    <string name="tutorial_movement_body">Give your exercise a name (e.g. \'Bench Press\'), then select the movement it trains.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sets_title">3. Add your sets</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sets_body">Add your sets: reps and intensity (%). The suggested weight is calculated automatically. Then press Save — your first exercise is ready!</string>
